This repository contains no third-party source code. LifeContext installs the
Python packages listed in pyproject.toml from PyPI, and on first start the
memory engine downloads machine-learning models from Hugging Face. Each
keeps its own license, summarised below. The upstream license texts apply.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Memory engine
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Hindsight (hindsight-all, hindsight-api-slim, hindsight-embed,
hindsight-client 0.9.2)
  Copyright (c) 2025 Vectorize AI, Inc.
  License: MIT
  https://pypi.org/project/hindsight-all/

pg0-embedded 0.15.1 (embedded PostgreSQL used by Hindsight)
  License: MIT
  https://github.com/vectorize-io/pg0
  The pg0 binary bundles PostgreSQL 18 and pgvector and unpacks them under
  ~/.pg0 on first start. PostgreSQL and pgvector are distributed under the
  PostgreSQL License. On Linux the binary also bundles libxml2 (MIT License)
  and ICU (Unicode License).

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models downloaded on first start
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files are fetched from huggingface.co into ~/.cache/huggingface. They are
not part of this repository or of the LifeContext package. Licenses as stated
on the Hugging Face model pages on 2026-10-17:

BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (text embeddings; Hindsight's default local
embedding model)
  License: MIT
  https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5

nreimers/mmarco-mMiniLMv2-L6-H384-v1 (multilingual reranker; selected by
LifeContext in src/lifecontext/hindsight.py)
  License: none declared. The model page has no license tag and no model
  card; its base model, nreimers/mMiniLMv2-L6-H384-distilled-from-XLMR-Large,
  declares none either. LifeContext does not distribute these files and
  grants no rights in them; Hindsight downloads them from Hugging Face on your
  machine. The model was trained on mMARCO, a machine translation of the MS
  MARCO passage-ranking data. The mMARCO dataset card states Apache License
  2.0; MS MARCO's own terms limit its use to non-commercial research. Review
  these terms before relying on the model, in particular for commercial use.
  https://huggingface.co/nreimers/mmarco-mMiniLMv2-L6-H384-v1
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/unicamp-dl/mmarco

